# OpenTrivia API Streamlit Quiz App

This repository includes a Streamlit quiz application and local educational retrieval mini projects.

## Run the quiz app

```bash
pip install streamlit requests
streamlit run quiz.py
```

## Local retrieval mini project

The local BM25 FAQ search project is in:

`local_quiz_search`

Run its tests with:

```bash
cd local_quiz_search
python -m unittest discover -s tests -p "test_*.py"
```
